| Lifecycle        | Action |
|-----------------|--------|
| **Mounted**      | Create tweens and ScrollTriggers inside **gsap.context(scope)**. |
| **Unmount / Destroy** | Call **ctx.revert()** so all animations and ScrollTriggers in that context are killed and inline styles reverted. |

